Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Kaleo Forms Admin|
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|workflowAssetType|Process|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Assert Can Edit Pending Form
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Process
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Process Details
		|kfProcessDescription|Kaleo Forms Process Description|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|${kfFieldSetName}|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Field Set
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|${kfFieldSetName}|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Workflow
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Single Approver|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin assign Form
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowTask|create|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Form
		|kfFormName|Created Task Form|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Form
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Form
		|kfFormName|Created Task Form|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin view Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow view Default My Workflow Tasks CP
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin submit New Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin populate Field Text
		|fieldName|Text|
		|kfProcessFieldData|Test|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Process Record
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow goto Assigned To My Roles
	Then Workflow view Task Assigned To My Roles Details
		|workflowAssetTitle|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowTask|Review|
